# Tourism Management System

## 📌 Description
A web-based Tourism Management System designed to simplify travel planning and booking processes. The system allows users to explore tour packages, manage bookings, and access travel-related information efficiently. It helps automate tourism operations and reduce manual workload. 

## ⚠️ Contribution Note
This project was developed in collaboration with a senior developer. I contributed to specific features and assisted in implementing and understanding real-world application workflows.

## 🚀 Features
- User registration and login  
- Browse and explore tour packages  
- Tour booking and management  
- Admin dashboard for managing users and packages  
- Inquiry and complaint handling  

